# Secret Identity, Reveal: "Until end of turn, target creature you control becomes a Hero with base power and toughness 3/4
# and gains flying and vigilance." Bot2 casts Pyroclasm; in response Bot1 reveals one of its two Ornithopters. The stack
# resolves Secret Identity first: that Ornithopter is a 3/4 Hero (its Thopter type replaced, still an artifact creature,
# flying kept from its own text and vigilance gained), so Pyroclasm's 2 damage is not lethal; the other 0/2 Ornithopter dies.

